  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participatory Action against Corruption: Towards Transparency and Accountability (PACTA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To protect civic space, provide platforms and tools to monitor public service delivery and raise voices against corruption. The project will be implemented at the local and national levels with the support of other donors.</narrative>
